------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end)
------------------------------------------------------------
- Data sources: useVehicles + useVehicleState + useQuery(/signals/{id}/live) + useDateFormat + useTranslation
  bound via the P1/S8 ChargingScheduleSource seam (ChargingScheduleUpdate snapshots). NO HTTP in the view.
- parseScheduleSignals -> ChargingScheduleAdapter.parseSignals (string / truthy-bool ('true'|true) /
  number coercions for ScheduledChargingMode/Pending/StartTime/DepartureTime/ChargeLimitSoc).
- modeLabel / modeBadgeVariant -> ChargingScheduleMode + tone(for:) + Strings.modeLabel (StartAt/DepartBy
  -> success, Off -> neutral, other/unknown -> warning; unknown raw label preserved as `mode ?? 'Unknown'`).
- timelineItems useMemo -> Adapter.timelineEntries: Start Charging (bolt, green, optional Pending subtitle)
  when non-empty start time; Departure (clock, blue) when non-empty departure; Target Limit (battery, amber)
  when ChargeLimitSoc set. hasScheduleData uses `startTime != null` (so "" counts) while the row uses the
  truthy `if (schedule.startTime)` (so "" is skipped) -> surfaces "No scheduled times set" — parity preserved.
- formatTime ({hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}) -> ChargingScheduleFormat.time (locale+tz DateFormatter
  with a 2-digit-hour pattern; nil/empty/invalid -> em-dash '—'). ${chargeLimit}% -> Format.percent.
- WidgetShell loading/stale/error/refresh + Badge + Timeline + EmptyState -> native glass shell + freshness
  chip + stale/offline banner + ContentUnavailableView. Compact (cols<=1 && rows<=1) charge-limit hero reproduced.
- States (all rendered): loading (skeleton), empty ("No schedule data"), error ("Couldn't load schedule"+retry),
  stale (chip+banner, cached visible), offline (chip+banner, cached visible), content; inner "No scheduled times set".
- i18n: all 16 source keys (Charging Schedule, Start At, Depart By, Off, Unknown, Start Charging, Pending,
  Departure, Target Limit, Charge Limit, No schedule data, No scheduled times set, Current Level, Status,
  Charging, Not Charging) via the ChargingScheduleStrings table (P1/S10). No English string literals in code.
- Accessibility: combined VoiceOver labels on every chip/row/cell, freshness a11y label, Dynamic-Type system
  fonts (Font.TS), reduce-motion honored (hero numericText animation + TSSkeleton shimmer gated).
- Telemetry (P1/S11): emits view.opened with surface slug "ChargingScheduleWidget" on appear (once).

